        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "One major application of biotechnology is developing new treatments and preventive measures for diseases.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The core mission of biotechnology is summarized as 'heal, feed, and fuel the world'.",
        "confidence": 0.93
