    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "the theme that we've chosen for this year is it starts with one. And what do we mean by that? We mean that, well, this is just described as a collaborative industry, but it usually starts with maybe one researcher at a laboratory bench looking into a microscope and learning something. that gives her a eureka moment, maybe one conversation at the convention over a cup of coffee that leads to a new collaboration. One parent who's insisting on trying to find a cure for a child. So that single-minded initiative that then leads to collaborations, that leads to breakthroughs, that leads to changes in the way we live and the hope that patients have for their futures.",
